<urn:atm:triage:finding/BB3-014>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "BB3-014" ;
  triage:title "colima-hermes-skills.md's Steps table is missing the testbed-ref row the runner emits" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr BB3-QA3-1789250000 (Final verdict FAIL, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1445#issuecomment-5648698551, 2026-09-12T21:08:20Z; BB3-QA3-B2), reviewed at 66be1d012. docs/procedures/colima-hermes-skills.md:32 (and identically in its ## Revision 6040ecf3 section): the Steps table has no row for the testbed ref case. scripts/smoke/colima_skill_report.py:61-81 (header_cases) emits four header rows (doctor, advertised host, herdr transport, testbed ref) prepended to every run's cases[], but the doc's table jumps from row 3 (herdr transport) straight to row 4 (atm-setup-environment / tester: Start line) -- confirmed directly by reading both the runner source and the doc. The doc's 48 steps do not read straight across to the runner's real 49 cases[] entries, violating D1's per-add_case-row contract and AC2." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-bb" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
